<view class="page recognition-page">
  <view class="recognition-hero"><text class="eyebrow">自然观察 · AI 识别</text><view class="page-title">你好，这片绿。</view><view class="subtitle">靠近一朵花，发现它的名字。</view><view class="hero-leaf leaf-a"></view><view class="hero-leaf leaf-b"></view></view>
  <view class="observe-tabs"><view class="observe-tab active">花卉识别</view><view class="observe-tab" bindtap="assessment">河道观察 <text>↗</text></view></view>
  <view class="flow-steps"><view class="flow-step {{!imagePath ? 'current' : 'done'}}"><text class="step-number">1</text><text>选择照片</text></view><view class="step-line"></view><view class="flow-step {{imagePath && !task.result_view ? 'current' : ''}}"><text class="step-number">2</text><text>开始识别</text></view><view class="step-line"></view><view class="flow-step {{task.result_view ? 'current' : ''}}"><text class="step-number">3</text><text>认识花卉</text></view></view>
  <view class="notice" wx:if="{{capabilityKnown && !capability.enabled}}">花卉识别暂未开放，已保存的识别记录仍可查看。</view>
  <view class="error-inline" wx:if="{{capabilityError}}">{{capabilityError}}</view>
  <view class="upload-panel section">
    <block wx:if="{{imagePath}}"><image class="preview" src="{{imagePath}}" mode="aspectFit" /><button class="replace" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="choose">重新选择照片</button></block>
    <block wx:else><button class="leaf-camera" hover-class="leaf-camera-pressed" bindtap="choose" disabled="{{busy}}" aria-label="拍照或从相册选择花卉照片"><view class="camera-glyph"><view class="camera-lens"></view></view><text>拍照 / 选图</text></button><view class="title upload-title">让花朵成为画面的主角</view><view class="copy">对焦清晰，保留花瓣与叶片细节</view><view class="file-tip">JPEG / PNG / WebP · 最大 5MB</view></block>
  </view>
  <view class="small muted gap" wx:if="{{imageUnavailable}}">{{imageUnavailable}}</view>
  <view wx:if="{{!loggedIn}}" class="gap"><button class="primary" bindtap="login">登录，开启自然观察</button><view class="small muted centered gap">登录后可保存和查看自己的识别记录。</view></view>
  <block wx:else><button wx:if="{{imageOrigin !== 'history' && !task.result_view}}" class="primary gap" disabled="{{busy || !capabilityKnown || !capability.enabled || !imagePath || task.status === 'queued' || task.status === 'running'}}" loading="{{busy}}" bindtap="submit">{{busy ? '正在上传照片' : task.status === 'queued' || task.status === 'running' ? '正在识别这朵花' : '开始识别'}}</button><view class="small muted centered gap">请上传有权使用的图片。<text class="privacy-link" bindtap="privacy">隐私与图片保留说明</text></view></block>
  <view class="scope-card section"><view class="row" bindtap="toggleHelp"><view><view class="title">先了解可识别的花卉</view><view class="small muted gap">当前支持五类花卉，结果供观察参考</view></view><text class="help-toggle">{{helpExpanded ? '收起 −' : '展开 +'}}</text></view><block wx:if="{{helpExpanded}}"><view class="copy gap">{{capability.scope}}</view><view class="scope-labels"><text wx:for="{{capability.labels}}" wx:key="id">{{item.name}}</text></view><view class="small muted gap" wx:if="{{capability.modelName}}">{{capability.modelName}} · {{capability.modelVersion}}</view><view class="copy">{{capability.thresholdNote}}</view><view class="copy">拍摄范围之外的植物或其他物品，可能被误识别为这五类，请结合实物核对。</view></block></view>
  <view class="card section task-card" wx:if="{{task && !task.result_view}}"><view class="row"><text class="title">{{task.status_label}}</text><view wx:if="{{task.status === 'queued' || task.status === 'running'}}" class="loading-leaf"></view></view><view class="copy">{{task.error_label || (task.status === 'queued' ? '照片已收到，正在等候识别。' : task.status === 'running' ? '正在观察花瓣与叶片，请稍候。' : '本次未获得可展示的识别结果。')}}</view><view class="small muted gap">{{task.created_label}}</view><button class="secondary gap" bindtap="refreshTask">刷新结果</button></view>
  <recognition-result wx:if="{{task && task.result_view}}" result="{{task.result_view}}" bindcontent="openContent" bindretake="choose" />
  <view wx:if="{{task.result_view}}" class="card section ai-next"><view class="row"><view><text class="ai-model">✦ DeepSeek Flash</text><view class="title gap">听听这朵花的故事</view></view><text class="ai-orbit">AI</text></view><view class="copy">核对候选特征，了解更多植物知识。原图可由你主动选择附带。</view><button class="secondary gap" bindtap="openAI" disabled="{{busy}}">问问 AI</button></view>
  <page-state loading="{{loading}}" error="{{error}}" bindretry="refreshTask" />
  <view class="section" wx:if="{{jobs.length}}"><view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">最近的发现</text><text class="small muted">仅自己可见</text></view><view class="card history-row" wx:for="{{jobs}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="openJob"><view class="record-leaf"></view><view class="grow"><view class="title">{{item.result_view ? item.result_view.heading : item.status_label}}</view><view class="copy" wx:if="{{item.error_label}}">{{item.error_label}}</view><view class="small muted gap">{{item.created_label}}</view></view><text class="chevron">›</text></view></view>
  <view class="footer-note">慢慢观察，自然会给你答案</view>
</view>
